# Try the API without any extra tool: open this file in Visual Studio (or VS Code + "REST Client"),
# start the API (F5), and click "Send request" above any request.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Log in as the demo surveyor
# @name staffLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/staff/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeId": "SURV001", "password": "DevPass123!" }

### 2. Who am I?  (uses the token from request 1)
@token = {{staffLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register a new citizen
POST {{host}}/api/auth/citizen/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalId": "2000000002",
  "fullName": "Test Citizen",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phoneNumber": "0792222222",
  "address": "Amman, Jordan"
}

### Log in as the demo citizen
POST {{host}}/api/auth/citizen/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nationalId": "1000000001", "password": "DevPass123!" }

### Health check
GET {{host}}/api/health
